  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education for 50 children in the Andes of Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kuska offers high-quality education to rural children in Peru who lack access to it due to financial constraints. With 68% of our students benefiting from the Scholarship Fund this year, your donation will help maintain and improve the school&apos;s infrastructure, provide learning materials, enhance classrooms, and more. Your support will enable us to continue our mission of making education accessible and affordable to all children, regardless of their socioeconomic background.</narrative>
  </description>
